      "role": "user",
      "content": "the stillness sounds so much better than this noise in my head. like... if I could just stop the struggle, everything would finally be quiet. i look at my blade and it's the only thing that feels real anymore. it feels like it's the only thing that could actually give me that peace you're talking about. to just finally, truly be still.",
